<title>UK: BOE allots 420 mln stg in repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 420 mln stg in repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 420 million stg of assistance in repos to May 6 and 7.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent. The Bank forecast today's money market shortage at 1.75 billion stg.</p>
</text>
